ll,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-brand-ink list-none flex justify-between items-center","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"如果被 IRS 审计发现错误申报，处罚标准是什么？"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200","children":"▼"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/70","children":"根据 IRC § 6662，因疏忽或故意漠视规则导致的报税错误，可处以应缴补税金额 20% 的罚款。若涉及民事税务欺诈，罚款可高达 75%。此外，逾期利息（Underpayment Interest）将每日复利计算。"}]]}],["$","details","3",{"className":"rounded-[24px] border border-brand-pink/35 bg-white p-5 shadow-[0_4px_20px_rgba(244,185,200,0.1)] group","children":[["$","summary",null,{"className":"cursor-pointer text-sm sm:text-base font-semibold text-brand-ink list-none flex justify-between items-center","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"美国转账多少会被查？"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-brand-pinkdeep group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform duration-200","children":"▼"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-brand-ink/70","children":"原则上，任何高于 10,000 美元的单笔或关联现金交易都会被银行自动向国税局 (IRS) 报告 (Form 8300)。对于正常的跨国汇款或生活费，并不一定会被查，但要保存好资金来源证明以应对潜在审计。"}]]}]]}]]}]}]}]
